      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1903-04-17_WidnesExaminer_art0016" n="art0016">
        <head>BLOOD AND THE SKIN, How Bile Beans cure Pimples and</head>
        <p>THE BLOOD AND THE SKIN, How Bile Beans cure Pimples and</p>
        <p>Blotches.</p>
        <p>Skin eruptions are now very prevalent. They are due toblood impurities. The bloodfilters through the liver. Therefore, if the liver is sluggish and impure so is the blood.lf the blood is impure,pimples and blotches appear. Purify the . blood; put an end to the blotches. One thing. doos both—Bile Beans. Mr. George Davis, of Wreath Quay-road, Monkwear- mouth, says I was almost covered with unsightly pimples, boils, and blotches. My arms, legs, hands, and hody were all attacked, and the irritation and paia was almost unbearable. Apart from the pain T was most dis- agreeable to look upon, and was ashamed to go *Tit My liver was out of order [this was the root cause of his trouble]. I was always drowsy and listless—as tired in the morning as at night. Sick-headache often</p>
        <p>overcame me. I was costive, and I felt as wretched as a man can feel. On the advice of at friend, I took Bile Beans. They soon ended the constipation, and their action on the liver was manifest by the way in which my blood was purified, and the boils and pimples grew less and less. Within a short time of commencing with Bile Beans my skin was quite cleared. I was relieved of the nasty drowsy sleepy feelings which had been so troublesome. The nausea and sickness also left me. I am now quite cured, and enjoy excellent health. Indeed, I have better health now than I ever remember to have had in my life." For (skin eruptions, liver complaints, constipation, piles, sick-headache female ailments, dizziness. &amp;c., Bile Beans are the finest remedy. All chemists supply them at Is. lid. and 2s. Od. per box. Be sure to get "Chas. Forde's." You'll see the name on each box.</p>
